        <mxCell id="seg-95" value="Each slice is a switch and a resistor, and the resistor carries the code. In the netlist: Rpu3 nu3 out {runit + (npu&amp;gt;=3 ? 0 : 1e9)}." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1A1A1A;" vertex="1" parent="seg-1">
